# document-evolution-tracker

cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "document-evolution-tracker: document version alignment and concept lineage"
type: software
version: 1.2.0
license: MIT
date-created: 2026-10-15
authors:
  - family-names: "Shi"
    given-names: "Jiaming"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JiamingShi-JsPhys/agent-skills"
description: "Tracks how a document evolves across versions: paragraph-level diffs and a concept-lineage matrix (introduced / retained / modified / dropped). Pure standard library; PyYAML optional for YAML configs. Emits Markdown + JSON timelines."
keywords:
  - document-versioning
  - concept-lineage
  - diff
  - timeline
  - version-alignment
